      "message": "[warning] Line 89: 🟡 The cursor key now ignores `peerId`; if `clientId` is only unique per participant/device namespace, two peers with the same client ID will overwrite/remove each other\u0027s cursors. Key by both `peerId` and `clientId` unless the daemon contract guarantees global uniqueness.",
